{"title":"2000 SMT/Advanced Topics Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers which are the sums of the cubes of their digits.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"SMT_Solution\">SMT Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: SMT Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b4d5a81093ab8566c362795140748d3feb73533.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbf{153,370,371,407}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"150\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Credit\">Credit</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Credit\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Problem and solution were taken from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://sumo.stanford.edu/old/smt/2000/\">https://sumo.stanford.edu/old/smt/2000/</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016202612\nCache expiry: 86400\nRe